{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live Dylan\u2019s Last Exam</strong> \u2014 a heartfelt, hand-drawn watercolor adventure where every choice matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Explore &amp; Uncover:</strong><br>Wander through a beautifully crafted city on Dylan\u2019s final exam day. Meet quirky locals, revisit his past, and discover hidden memories around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Puzzle Your Way Forward:</strong><br>Solve environmental and logic puzzles using observation and intuition. Every challenge draws you deeper into Dylan\u2019s world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcad Personal Storytelling:</strong><br>Unravel Dylan\u2019s relationships, anxieties, and hopes through tender interactions and emotional flashbacks. A bittersweet journey of memory, healing, and self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2728 Why You\u2019ll Love It:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning watercolor visuals</strong> that feel like moving paintings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy, reflective pacing</strong> \u2014 ideal for a quiet afternoon of immersive gaming.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A touching, slice\u2011of\u2011life narrative</strong> with universal themes of growth and closure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted city filled with character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in puzzles that blend logic with emotional storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal Dylan\u2019s backstory through voice\u2011rich dialogue and warm scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an atmospheric, single\u2011player narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supporting Windows &amp; macOS (64\u2011bit)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2329900?t=1769676908","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329900/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769676908","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329900/0ddf1c79e2004889d9e0c9064c739b2f4c35fb94/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769676908","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329900/0ddf1c79e2004889d9e0c9064c739b2f4c35fb94/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769676908","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3168080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>\ud83c\udf89 The Last Exam is going to Gamescom 2025!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re proud to be part of the Indie Arena Booth this year \u2014 and even more excited to share our brand-new demo with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try it now on Steam and come visit us in Cologne this August!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live Dylan\u2019s Last Exam</strong> \u2014 a heartfelt, hand-drawn watercolor adventure where every choice matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Explore &amp; Uncover:</strong><br>Wander through a beautifully crafted city on Dylan\u2019s final exam day. Meet quirky locals, revisit his past, and discover hidden memories around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Puzzle Your Way Forward:</strong><br>Solve environmental and logic puzzles using observation and intuition. Every challenge draws you deeper into Dylan\u2019s world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcad Personal Storytelling:</strong><br>Unravel Dylan\u2019s relationships, anxieties, and hopes through tender interactions and emotional flashbacks. A bittersweet journey of memory, healing, and self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2728 Why You\u2019ll Love It:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning watercolor visuals</strong> that feel like moving paintings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy, reflective pacing</strong> \u2014 ideal for a quiet afternoon of immersive gaming.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A touching, slice\u2011of\u2011life narrative</strong> with universal themes of growth and closure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted city filled with character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in puzzles that blend logic with emotional storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal Dylan\u2019s backstory through voice\u2011rich dialogue and warm scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an atmospheric, single\u2011player narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supporting Windows &amp; macOS (64\u2011bit)</p></li></ul>","developers":["Neslihan Ayd\u0131no\u011flu"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329900/04e47d05b2ee656a671546f882fb8410b17efa0a/header.jpg?t=1769676908","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.11 (El Capitan) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4570 (4 * 3200)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GT 755M<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor